{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object visible, then take it, move to storage, check it, do specific task. Else, scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToObjectStorage    /> <Action ID = IsObjectInReach    />",
